  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0170" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00513/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#hand_blue_kelly">
              <opener>
                <seg>
                <placeName>
                  <lb/>Barn Cottage,
                  <lb/>Boars Hill,
                  <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_kelly"><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_46">Oxford</rs>.</hi> 
                  <lb/>
                </placeName>
                </seg>
                <dateline>  
                  <date>
                    <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#hand_blue_kelly">29th June 1967</hi>
                  </date>
                </dateline>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Wystan</rs>,
                </salute>
                </opener>
                <p>
                  <lb/>I have recently <rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_400">set your poem
                  <lb/><rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_401">'Shield of Achilles'</rs> for Tenor, timp and per<unclear>cus</unclear> and
                  <lb/>String Orchestra</rs>. <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_363">Novellos</rs> wish to publish this
                  <lb/>and I belive they have contacted your <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_29">agent</rs>
                  <lb/>for permission to use the <rs type="lit_work" ref="#lit_work_id_401">poem</rs> - I thought
                  <lb/>I should like to tell you about this though
                  <lb/>to have your blessing.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <lb/>The <rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_364">'Society for the
                  <lb/>Promotion of New Music'</rs> want to give a first
                  <lb/>performance but this has not been completely
                  <lb/>settled.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <lb/>I am off to <rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_566">Malaysia</rs> on the 13th of
                  <lb/>July until 19th September listening to the
                  <lb/>natives playing the European Classics which
                  <lb/>should be fun.
                </p>
                <closer>
                  <salute>
                    <lb/>Hope things are well with you <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1"><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_4">both</rs></rs>,
                  </salute>
                  <salute>
                    <lb/>Love,
                  </salute>
                  <signed>
                    <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_557">Bryan Kelly</rs>
                  </signed>
                </closer>
              </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00514/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
            <div>
              <ab hand="#hand_blue_unident_0170">
                <lb/>43
              </ab>
            </div>
          </div>
      </div>
    </body>
